From fcabf20f4fc98c49ae72e6a7addc1b91b37ea605 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Guy Hartstein <guyh2020@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 11:34:41 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat: export transport and typed request errors

Add createTransport (post/get/stream returning raw bodies) and
TavilyRequestError (status, body, docs). Typed client methods now use the
transport, leaving one header builder and one error path.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
